  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "\xA1EL HURAC\xC1N RETURNS! Did you see the fight? I won. Of course I won. El
    Gringo Loco cried. Then he filed his taxes."
  - Tonight, the rematch. He says I cheated. I did not cheat. I used a CHAIR. Chairs
    are legal in my heart.
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1EL HURAC\xC1N AGRADECE! Tonight, the belt comes home!"
  lineIfRejected: "The registration? It's in my TRUE name! The name the people chant!
    ...Bah. The Hurac\xE1n will return. The Hurac\xE1n always returns."
  lineIfImprisoned: "You cannot cage a HURAC\xC1N! ...Okay, you can. The mask stays
    on."
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 0}
